WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.993
Your people bring the ideas, the craft, and the judgement.
Here, the studio decides what makes the game fun.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.963
AI takes care of the work around it. Like preparing the
playtest invitation.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.730
While it drafts, you keep shaping the experience.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:35.792
The invitation is ready. Your creative direction stays
yours.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.808
Now step into the shared computer, and try the game
yourself.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:50.633
Does this feel good? Do both players feel needed? That is
a judgement for the people making it.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:02.171
Keep the quiet pace. Improve what matters. Put that
feedback beside the work.

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:18.611
Restless brings your people and AI together, so there is
more time for the work you are here to do.
